{"id":"d70ce677a3070a45","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-eq-functor.md","title":"带参数的简单等式","display":"df-equality-functor — 带参数的简单等式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-eq-functor","aliases":["16-df-eq-functor","Equality functor"],"display":"df-equality-functor — 带参数的简单等式","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-frobenius]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definition 3.4.1, pp. 190–191 (PDF 210–211)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-eq-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-eq-functor</span><span>Equality functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equality-functor — 带参数的简单等式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac2effb31369eeeb\" href=\"?note=ac2effb31369eeeb\" title=\"16-df-frobenius\">16-df-frobenius</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 3.4.1, pp. 190–191 (PDF 210–211)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为具有固定提升选择的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>；全部重索引使用该同一选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2\\rangle:I\\times J\\to(I\\times J)\\times J\">\\(\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2\\rangle:I\\times J\\to(I\\times J)\\times J\\)</span> 复制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>，保留参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\delta(u,J)\">\\(S_\\delta(u,J)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 正式构造，其上下边是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J\">\\(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J\">\\((u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J\\)</span>，两竖边是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{K,J},\\delta_{I,J}\">\\(\\delta_{K,J},\\delta_{I,J}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:K\\to I\">\\(u:K\\to I\\)</span>）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFrob}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFrob}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasEq}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathfrak e=(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 是候选族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}:\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\to\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}:\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\to\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\\)</span> 为函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{I,J}\">\\(\\Phi_{I,J}\\)</span> 为候选自然 Hom 双射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span> 在下文定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>，带数据参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac2effb31369eeeb\" href=\"?note=ac2effb31369eeeb\" title=\"16-df-frobenius\">16-df-frobenius</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p)\\)</span> 的正分支先给出纤维有限积的存在性；该分支内固定一族有限积见证后使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Frob}_p(u;L,\\Phi)\\)</span>，其真值不依赖这族有限积见证的选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l_J=\\pi_2:1\\times J\\xrightarrow{\\sim}J\">\\(l_J=\\pi_2:1\\times J\\xrightarrow{\\sim}J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_J=\\langle\\pi_2\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\rangle:(1\\times J)\\times J\\xrightarrow{\\sim}J\\times J\">\\(r_J=\\langle\\pi_2\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\rangle:(1\\times J)\\times J\\xrightarrow{\\sim}J\\times J\\)</span>；独立 Hom 同构式与无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_J\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_J\\)</span> 仅在选定满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasEq}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasEq}(p)\\)</span> 的同一等式伴随族后使用；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\">\\(Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_J\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_J\\)</span> 使用下文同构运输构造。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{I,J}\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle,\\qquad\nS_\\delta(u,J)\\coloneqq(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\delta_{K,J},\\delta_{I,J},(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{I,J}\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle,\\qquad\nS_\\delta(u,J)\\coloneqq(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\delta_{K,J},\\delta_{I,J},(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"l_J\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{1,J},\\qquad\nr_J\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_2^{1,J}\\pi_1^{1\\times J,J},\\pi_2^{1\\times J,J}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[l_J\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{1,J},\\qquad\nr_J\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_2^{1,J}\\pi_1^{1\\times J,J},\\pi_2^{1\\times J,J}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\delta_{I,J}^*,\\Phi_{I,J}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S_\\delta(u,J);\\mathsf{Eq}_{K,J},\\Phi_{K,J},\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasEq}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\mathfrak e)\\ \\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists\\mathfrak e)\\Bigl[\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(\\delta_{I,J};\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\delta_{I,J}^*,\\Phi_{I,J}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\\\\n\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S_\\delta(u,J);\\mathsf{Eq}_{K,J},\\Phi_{K,J},\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{EqAdjData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasEq}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\mathfrak e)\\ \\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\exists\\mathfrak e)\\Bigl[\\mathrm{SimpleEqData}_p(\\mathfrak e)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Frob}_p(\\delta_{I,J};\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}Y,X)\n\\cong\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}(Y,\\delta_{I,J}^*X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_{(I\\times J)\\times J}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}Y,X)\n\\cong\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}(Y,\\delta_{I,J}^*X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_J\\coloneqq(r_J^{-1})^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}l_J^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Eq}_J\\coloneqq(r_J^{-1})^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}l_J^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>伴随族在后续的参数换基条件中保持同一选择；BC 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id})^*\\cong((u\\times\\operatorname{id})\\times\\operatorname{id})^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id})^*\\cong((u\\times\\operatorname{id})\\times\\operatorname{id})^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>不要求任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{J}\\cong\\mathsf{Eq}_{I}u^*\">\\((u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{J}\\cong\\mathsf{Eq}_{I}u^*\\)</span>。子对象模型中非单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 已能反驳此式。</li>\n<li>无参数记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_J\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_J\\)</span> 经单位积同构指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_{J\\times J}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_{J\\times J}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 3.4.1, pp. 190–191 (PDF 210–211)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-frobenius","status":"resolved","id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-frobenius]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c